{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e1", "type": "leave", "agent": "mr_dursley", "patient": null, "location": "number_four", "source_text": "Mr. Dursley picked up his briefcase, pecked Mrs. Dursley on the cheek, and tried to kiss Dudley good-bye but missed."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e2", "type": "discover", "agent": "mr_dursley", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "It was on the corner of the street that he noticed the first sign of something peculiar \u2014 a cat reading a map."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e3", "type": "arrive", "agent": "mr_dursley", "patient": null, "location": "grunnings", "source_text": "Mr. Dursley arrived in the Grunnings parking lot, his mind back on drills."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e4", "type": "talk", "agent": "mr_dursley", "patient": null, "location": "grunnings", "source_text": "He yelled at five different people."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e5", "type": "discover", "agent": "mr_dursley", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "The cat was still there. It was staring down Privet Drive as though it were waiting for something."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e6", "type": "arrive", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "A man appeared on the corner the cat had been watching, appeared so suddenly and silently you\u2019d have thought he\u2019d just popped out of the ground."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e7", "type": "talk", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": "professor_mcgonagall", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Fancy seeing you here, Professor McGonagall."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e8", "type": "arrive", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "A huge motorcycle fell out of the air and landed on the road in front of them."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e9", "type": "give", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Dumbledore took Harry in his arms and turned toward the Dursleys\u2019 house."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e10", "type": "leave", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Hagrid swung himself onto the motorcycle and kicked the engine into life; with a roar it rose into the air and off into the night."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e11", "type": "leave", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Dumbledore turned and walked back down the street."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e12", "type": "discover", "agent": "mrs_dursley", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "number_four", "source_text": "He would be woken in a few hours\u2019 time by Mrs. Dursley\u2019s scream as she opened the front door to put out the milk bottles."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e13", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "\"Up! Get up! Now!\""}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e14", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\"Comb your hair!\""}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e15", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "dudley_dursley", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\"And we\u2019ll buy you another two presents while we\u2019re out today.\""}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e16", "type": "arrive", "agent": "piers_polkiss", "patient": null, "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "Piers Polkiss walked in with his mother."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e17", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "zoo", "source_text": "Harry, who couldn\u2019t believe his luck, was sitting in the back of the Dursleys\u2019 car..."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e18", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "reptile_house", "source_text": "The snake suddenly opened its beady eyes."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e19", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "reptile_house", "source_text": "\"Where do you come from, anyway?\""}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e20", "type": "escape", "agent": "boa_constrictor", "patient": null, "location": "reptile_house", "source_text": "The glass front of the boa constrictor\u2019s tank had vanished."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e21", "type": "talk", "agent": "piers_polkiss", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "\"Harry was talking to it, weren\u2019t you, Harry?\""}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e22", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "\"Go \u2014 cupboard \u2014 stay \u2014 no meals,\""}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e23", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "letter", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "a letter for Harry."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e24", "type": "take", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "letter", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "it was jerked sharply out of his hand by Uncle Vernon."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e25", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "aunt_petunia", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "P-P-Petunia!\u201d he gasped."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e26", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "Vernon! Oh my goodness \u2014 Vernon!"}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e27", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "cupboard", "source_text": "I have burned it."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e28", "type": "move", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "smallest_bedroom", "source_text": "we think it might be nice if you moved into Dudley\u2019s second bedroom."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e29", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "letter", "location": "railview_hotel", "source_text": "Only I got about an \u2018undred of these at the front desk."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e30", "type": "leave", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "We\u2019re going away."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e31", "type": "arrive", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": null, "location": "railview_hotel", "source_text": "Uncle Vernon stopped at last outside a gloomy-looking hotel."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e32", "type": "talk", "agent": "dudley_dursley", "patient": "aunt_petunia", "location": "car", "source_text": "Daddy\u2019s gone mad, hasn\u2019t he?"}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e33", "type": "arrive", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": null, "location": "shack", "source_text": "Uncle Vernon was pointing at what looked like a large rock way out at sea."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e34", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "shack", "source_text": "Someone was outside, knocking to come in."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e35", "type": "arrive", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": null, "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "A giant of a man was standing in the doorway."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e36", "type": "talk", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "An\u2019 here\u2019s Harry!\u201d said the giant."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e37", "type": "give", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "birthday_cake", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Got summat fer yeh here \u2014 I mighta sat on it at some point, but it\u2019ll taste all right."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e38", "type": "talk", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Harry \u2014 yet a wizard."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e39", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "letter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Harry stretched out his hand at last to take the yellowish envelope."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e40", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Knew! Of course we knew! How could you not be, my dratted sister being what she was?"}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e41", "type": "attack", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "dudley", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "He brought the umbrella swishing down through the air to point at Dudley."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e42", "type": "talk", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Harry Potter, not a wizard \u2014 you wait, you\u2019ll be right famous at Hogwarts."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e43", "type": "think", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "hut", "source_text": "It was a dream, he told himself firmly."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e44", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "owl", "location": "hut", "source_text": "There was an owl rapping its claw on the window."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e45", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "hagrid", "location": "hut", "source_text": "Hagrid! said Harry loudly. There\u2019s an owl."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e46", "type": "give", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "coins", "location": "hut", "source_text": "Give him five Knuts, said Hagrid sleepily."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e47", "type": "leave", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "hut", "source_text": "Harry followed Hagrid out onto the rock."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e48", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "leaky_cauldron", "source_text": "This is it, said Hagrid, coming to a halt, the Leaky Cauldron."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e49", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "dedalus_diggle", "location": "leaky_cauldron", "source_text": "Delighted, Mr. Potter, just can\u2019t tell you, Diggle\u2019s the name, Dedalus Diggle."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e50", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "professor_quirrell", "location": "leaky_cauldron", "source_text": "Professor Quirrell! said Hagrid. Harry, Professor Quirrell will be one of your teachers at Hogwarts."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e51", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "wand", "location": "diagon_alley", "source_text": "Harry took the wand. He felt a sudden warmth in his fingers."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e52", "type": "talk", "agent": "mr_ollivander", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "diagon_alley", "source_text": "I think we must expect great things from you, Mr. Potter."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e53", "type": "leave", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "diagon_alley", "source_text": "The late afternoon sun hung low in the sky as Harry and Hagrid made their way back down Diagon Alley."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e54", "type": "leave", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "train", "source_text": "The train pulled out of the station."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e55", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "living_room", "source_text": "\u201cEr \u2014 Uncle Vernon?\u201d"}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e56", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "kings_cross_station", "source_text": "They reached King\u2019s Cross at half past ten."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e57", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "platform_nine_and_three_quarters", "location": "kings_cross_station", "source_text": "He had done it. Smoke from the engine drifted over the heads of the chattering crowd."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e58", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "molly_weasley", "location": "platform_nine_and_three_quarters", "source_text": "\u201cExcuse me,\u201d Harry said to the plump woman."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e59", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "\u201cAre you really Harry Potter?\u201d Ron blurted out."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e60", "type": "talk", "agent": "draco_malfoy", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "\u201cIs it true?\u201d he said. \u201cThey\u2019re saying all down the train that Harry Potter\u2019s in this compartment."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e61", "type": "attack", "agent": "scabbers", "patient": "goyle", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "Scabbers the rat was hanging off his finger, sharp little teeth sunk deep into Goyle\u2019s knuckle."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e62", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "hogwarts", "source_text": "\u201cYe\u2019 all get yer firs\u2019 sight o\u2019 Hogwarts in a sec,\u201d Hagrid called over his shoulder."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e63", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "entrance_hall", "source_text": "The door swung open at once."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e64", "type": "talk", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "first_years", "location": "small_chamber", "source_text": "Welcome to Hogwarts."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e65", "type": "meet", "agent": "first_years", "patient": "ghosts", "location": "small_chamber", "source_text": "About twenty ghosts had just streamed through the back wall."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e66", "type": "arrive", "agent": "first_years", "patient": null, "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "and they walked out of the chamber, back across the hall, and through a pair of double doors into the Great Hall."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e67", "type": "talk", "agent": "sorting_hat", "patient": "first_years", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "The hat twitched. A rip near the brim opened wide like a mouth \u2014 and the hat began to sing:"}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e68", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "sorting_hat", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Not Slytherin, eh?\u201d said the small voice."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e69", "type": "talk", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": "students", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Welcome to a new year at Hogwarts!"}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e70", "type": "talk", "agent": "nearly_headless_nick", "patient": "gryffindors", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "So \u2014 new Gryffindors! I hope you\u2019re going to help us win the house championship this year?"}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e71", "type": "talk", "agent": "peeves", "patient": "first_years", "location": "corridor", "source_text": "Oooooooh!\u201d he said, with an evil cackle. \u201cIckle Firsties! What fun!"}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e72", "type": "arrive", "agent": "first_years", "patient": null, "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "and found themselves in the Gryffindor common room, a cozy, round room full of squashy armchairs."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e73", "type": "arrive", "agent": "first_years", "patient": null, "location": "dormitory", "source_text": "At the top of a spiral staircase \u2014 they were obviously in one of the towers \u2014 they found their beds at last."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e74", "type": "think", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "dormitory", "source_text": "Perhaps Harry had eaten a bit too much, because he had a very strange dream."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e75", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "\u201cWhat have we got today?\u201d Harry asked Ron."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e76", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "note_from_hagrid", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Hedwig fluttered down... and dropped a note onto Harry\u2019s plate."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e77", "type": "talk", "agent": "severus_snape", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "dungeons", "source_text": "\u201cPotter!\u201d said Snape suddenly."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e78", "type": "help", "agent": "professor_quirrell", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hogwarts", "source_text": "they were rescued by Professor Quirrell, who was passing."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e79", "type": "attack", "agent": "severus_snape", "patient": "neville_longbottom", "location": "dungeons", "source_text": "\u201cIdiot boy!\u201d snarled Snape."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e80", "type": "help", "agent": "seamus_finnigan", "patient": "neville_longbottom", "location": "dungeons", "source_text": "\u201cTake him up to the hospital wing,\u201d Snape spat at Seamus."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e81", "type": "talk", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hagrid_house", "source_text": "\u201cMake yerselves at home,\u201d said Hagrid."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e82", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "null", "location": "hagrid_house", "source_text": "Harry picked up a piece of paper that was lying on the table."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e83", "type": "talk", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "hagrid_house", "source_text": "\u201cHow\u2019s yer brother Charlie?\u201d Hagrid asked Ron."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e84", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "remembrall", "location": "flying_lawn", "source_text": "Harry saw, as though in slow motion, the ball rise up in the air and then start to fall."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e85", "type": "take", "agent": "draco_malfoy", "patient": "remembrall", "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "Draco Malfoy, who was passing the Gryffindor table, snatched the Remembrall out of his hand."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e86", "type": "talk", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "flying_lawn", "source_text": "Professor McGonagall was running toward them."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e87", "type": "help", "agent": "madam_hooch", "patient": "neville_longbottom", "location": "flying_lawn", "source_text": "Madam Hooch was bending over Neville, her face as white as his."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e88", "type": "talk", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "I couldn\u2019t help overhearing what you and Malfoy were saying \u2014"}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e89", "type": "escape", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "forbidden_corridor", "source_text": "They fell backward \u2014 Harry slammed the door shut, and they ran, they almost flew, back down the corridor."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e90", "type": "discover", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": null, "location": "forbidden_corridor", "source_text": "It was standing on a trapdoor. It\u2019s obviously guarding something."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e91", "type": "talk", "agent": "ron_weasley", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "I\u2019m his second, who\u2019s yours?"}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e92", "type": "talk", "agent": "peeves", "patient": "filch", "location": "corridor", "source_text": "STUDENTS OUT OF BED!"}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e93", "type": "talk", "agent": "oliver_wood", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "empty_classroom", "source_text": "Potter, this is Oliver Wood. Wood \u2014 I\u2019ve found you a Seeker."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e94", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "nimbus_two_thousand", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "It contains your new Nimbus Two Thousand"}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e95", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Harry had difficulty hiding his glee as he handed the note to Ron to read."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e96", "type": "talk", "agent": "draco_malfoy", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "entrance_hall", "source_text": "Malfoy seized the package from Harry and felt it."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e97", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "oliver_wood", "location": "quidditch_field", "source_text": "Oliver Wood will meet you tonight on the Quidditch field at seven o\u2019clock for your first training session."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e98", "type": "talk", "agent": "oliver_wood", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "quidditch_field", "source_text": "Very nice, said Wood, his eyes glinting."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e99", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "troll_club", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "The troll was advancing on her, knocking the sinks off the walls as it went."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e100", "type": "attack", "agent": "ron_weasley", "patient": "troll_club", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "The club flew suddenly out of the troll\u2019s hand."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e101", "type": "help", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "If they hadn\u2019t found me, I\u2019d be dead now."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e102", "type": "talk", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "What on earth were you thinking of?"}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e103", "type": "talk", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "professor_mcgonagall", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "Please, Professor McGonagall \u2014 they were looking for me."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e104", "type": "leave", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": null, "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "Hermione left."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e105", "type": "talk", "agent": "ron_weasley", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "gryffindor_tower", "source_text": "Good of her to get us out of trouble like that."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e106", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "severus_snape", "location": "staffroom", "source_text": "Snape was holding his robes above his knees. One of his legs was bloody and mangled."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e107", "type": "talk", "agent": "severus_snape", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "staffroom", "source_text": "\u201cGET OUT! OUT!\u201d Harry left, before Snape could take any more points from Gryffindor."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e108", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "In a low whisper, Harry told them what he\u2019d seen."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e109", "type": "talk", "agent": "ron_weasley", "patient": "hermione_granger", "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "\u201cHonestly, Hermione, you think all teachers are saints or something,\u201d snapped Ron."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e110", "type": "talk", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "\u201cNo \u2014 he wouldn\u2019t, she said. \u201cI know he\u2019s not very nice, but he wouldn\u2019t try and steal something Dumbledore was keeping safe.\u201d"}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e111", "type": "play", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "golden_snitch", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "Harry was gliding over the game, squinting about for some sign of the Snitch."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e112", "type": "attack", "agent": "marcus_flint", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "Marcus Flint had blocked Harry on purpose, and Harry\u2019s broom spun off course."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e113", "type": "discover", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "severus_snape", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "\u201cI knew it,\u201d Hermione gasped, \u201cSnape \u2014 look.\u201d"}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e114", "type": "help", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "Bright blue flames shot from her wand onto the hem of Snape\u2019s robes."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e115", "type": "catch", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "golden_snitch", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "\u201cI\u2019ve got the Snitch!\u201d he shouted, waving it above his head."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e116", "type": "talk", "agent": "ron_weasley", "patient": "hagrid", "location": "hagrids_hut", "source_text": "\u201cIt was Snape,\u201d Ron was explaining, \u201cHermione and I saw him."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e117", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "hagrid", "location": "hagrids_hut", "source_text": "\u201cI found out something about him,\u201d he told Hagrid. \u201cHe tried to get past that three-headed dog on Halloween."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e1", "type": "leave", "agent": "mr_dursley", "patient": null, "location": "number_four", "source_text": "Mr. Dursley picked up his briefcase, pecked Mrs. Dursley on the cheek, and tried to kiss Dudley good-bye."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e2", "type": "discover", "agent": "mr_dursley", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "It was on the corner of the street that he noticed the first sign of something peculiar \u2014 a cat reading a map."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e3", "type": "talk", "agent": "mr_dursley", "patient": "mrs_dursley", "location": "number_four", "source_text": "Er \u2014 Petunia, dear \u2014 you haven\u2019t heard from your sister lately, have you?"}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e4", "type": "arrive", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "A man appeared on the corner the cat had been watching, appeared so suddenly and silently you\u2019d have thought he\u2019d just popped out of the ground."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e5", "type": "talk", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": "professor_mcgonagall", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Fancy seeing you here, Professor McGonagall."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e6", "type": "arrive", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "A huge motorcycle fell out of the air and landed on the road in front of them."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e7", "type": "give", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Dumbledore took Harry in his arms and turned toward the Dursleys\u2019 house."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e8", "type": "leave", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Hagrid swung himself onto the motorcycle and kicked the engine into life; with a roar it rose into the air and off into the night."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e9", "type": "leave", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Dumbledore turned and walked back down the street."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e10", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "\u201cUp! Get up! Now!\u201d"}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e11", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\u201cComb your hair!\u201d he barked"}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e12", "type": "talk", "agent": "dudley_dursley", "patient": "aunt_petunia", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\u201cThirty-six,\u201d he said, looking up at his mother and father."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e13", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "dudley_dursley", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\u201cAnd we\u2019ll buy you another two presents while we\u2019re out today."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e14", "type": "arrive", "agent": "piers_polkiss", "patient": null, "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "Dudley\u2019s best friend, Piers Polkiss, walked in with his mother."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e15", "type": "leave", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "Half an hour later, Harry... was sitting in the back of the Dursleys\u2019 car"}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e16", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "zoo", "source_text": "It was a very sunny Saturday and the zoo was crowded with families."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e17", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "reptile_house", "source_text": "The snake suddenly opened its beady eyes."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e18", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "reptile_house", "source_text": "\u201cWhere do you come from, anyway?\u201d Harry asked."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e19", "type": "escape", "agent": "snake", "patient": null, "location": "reptile_house", "source_text": "The glass front of the boa constrictor\u2019s tank had vanished."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e20", "type": "talk", "agent": "piers_polkiss", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "\u201cHarry was talking to it, weren\u2019t you, Harry?\u201d"}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e21", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "\u201cGo \u2014 cupboard \u2014 stay \u2014 no meals,\u201d"}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e22", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "letter", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "a letter for Harry."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e23", "type": "take", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "letter", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "it was jerked sharply out of his hand by Uncle Vernon."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e24", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "aunt_petunia", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "P-P-Petunia!\u201d he gasped."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e25", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "Vernon! Oh my goodness \u2014 Vernon!"}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e26", "type": "attack", "agent": "dudley_dursley", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "He gave his father a sharp tap on the head with his Smelting stick."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e27", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "cupboard", "source_text": "Where\u2019s my letter?\u201d said Harry, the moment Uncle Vernon had squeezed through the door."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e28", "type": "leave", "agent": "dursleys", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "They drove. And they drove."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e29", "type": "arrive", "agent": "dursleys", "patient": null, "location": "railview_hotel", "source_text": "Uncle Vernon stopped at last outside a gloomy-looking hotel."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e30", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "letter", "location": "railview_hotel", "source_text": "Only I got about an \u2018undred of these at the front desk."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e31", "type": "take", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "letter", "location": "railview_hotel", "source_text": "I\u2019ll take them,\u201d said Uncle Vernon."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e32", "type": "leave", "agent": "dursleys", "patient": null, "location": "railview_hotel", "source_text": "He drove them into the middle of a forest."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e33", "type": "arrive", "agent": "dursleys", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "They could hear the letters still streaming into the room."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e34", "type": "arrive", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": null, "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "A giant of a man was standing in the doorway."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e35", "type": "talk", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "An\u2019 here\u2019s Harry!\u201d said the giant."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e36", "type": "give", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "birthday_cake", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Got summat fer yeh here \u2014 I mighta sat on it at some point, but it\u2019ll taste all right."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e37", "type": "talk", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Harry \u2014 yet a wizard."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e38", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "letter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Harry stretched out his hand at last to take the yellowish envelope."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e39", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Knew! Of course we knew! How could you not be, my dratted sister being what she was?"}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e40", "type": "attack", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "dudley", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "He brought the umbrella swishing down through the air to point at Dudley."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e41", "type": "talk", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "NEVER - INSULT-ALBUS- DUMBLEDORE-IN- FRONT-OF- ME!"}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e42", "type": "think", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "hut", "source_text": "It was a dream, he told himself firmly."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e43", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "hagrid", "location": "hut", "source_text": "Hagrid! said Harry loudly."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e44", "type": "give", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "owl", "location": "hut", "source_text": "Harry counted out five little bronze coins."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e45", "type": "talk", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut", "source_text": "Best be Off, Harry, lots ter do today."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e46", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "leaky_cauldron", "source_text": "This is it, said Hagrid, coming to a halt, the Leaky Cauldron."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e47", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "tom_bartender", "location": "leaky_cauldron", "source_text": "Good Lord, said the bartender, peering at Harry."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e48", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "dedalus_diggle", "location": "leaky_cauldron", "source_text": "Delighted, Mr. Potter, just can\u2019t tell you, Diggle\u2019s the name, Dedalus Diggle."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e49", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "professor_quirrell", "location": "leaky_cauldron", "source_text": "Professor Quirrell! said Hagrid."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e50", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "diagon_alley", "source_text": "Welcome, said Hagrid, to Diagon Alley."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e51", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "wand", "location": "diagon_alley", "source_text": "Harry took the wand."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e52", "type": "talk", "agent": "mr_ollivander", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "diagon_alley", "source_text": "I think we must expect great things from you, Mr. Potter."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e53", "type": "leave", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "diagon_alley", "source_text": "The late afternoon sun hung low in the sky as Harry and Hagrid made their way back down Diagon Alley."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e54", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "\u201cEr \u2014 Uncle Vernon?\u201d"}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e55", "type": "leave", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "They reached King\u2019s Cross at half past ten."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e56", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "kings_cross_station", "source_text": "They reached King\u2019s Cross at half past ten."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e57", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "platform_nine_and_three_quarters", "location": "kings_cross_station", "source_text": "He opened his eyes. A scarlet steam engine was waiting next to a platform packed with people."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e58", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "\u201cAnyone sitting there?\u201d he asked, pointing at the seat opposite Harry."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e59", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "\u201cAre you really Harry Potter?\u201d Ron blurted out."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e60", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "hermione_granger", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "\u201cHas anyone seen a toad? Neville\u2019s lost one,\u201d she said."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e61", "type": "talk", "agent": "draco_malfoy", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "\u201cIs it true?\u201d he said. \u201cThey\u2019re saying all down the train that Harry Potter\u2019s in this compartment."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e62", "type": "attack", "agent": "scabbers", "patient": "goyle", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "Scabbers the rat was hanging off his finger, sharp little teeth sunk deep into Goyle\u2019s knuckle."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e63", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "hogwarts", "source_text": "\u201cYe\u2019 all get yer firs\u2019 sight o\u2019 Hogwarts in a sec,\u201d Hagrid called over his shoulder."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e64", "type": "help", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "neville_longbottom", "location": "hogwarts", "source_text": "\u201cOy, you there! Is this your toad?\u201d said Hagrid, who was checking the boats as people climbed out of them."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e65", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "hogwarts", "source_text": "They walked up a flight of stone steps and crowded around the huge, Oak front door."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e66", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "entrance_hall", "source_text": "The door swung open at once."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e67", "type": "talk", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "first_years", "location": "small_chamber", "source_text": "Welcome to Hogwarts."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e68", "type": "arrive", "agent": "ghosts", "patient": null, "location": "small_chamber", "source_text": "About twenty ghosts had just streamed through the back wall."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e69", "type": "talk", "agent": "sorting_hat", "patient": "first_years", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "The hat began to sing."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e70", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "sorting_hat", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Not Slytherin, eh? said the small voice."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e71", "type": "arrive", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": null, "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Albus Dumbledore had gotten to his feet."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e72", "type": "talk", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": "students", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Welcome to a new year at Hogwarts!"}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e73", "type": "talk", "agent": "sir_nicholas", "patient": "gryffindors", "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "Resident ghost of Gryffindor Tower."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e74", "type": "talk", "agent": "peeves", "patient": "first_years", "location": "corridor", "source_text": "Oooooooh! he said, with an evil cackle."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e75", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "gryffindor_dormitory", "source_text": "They found their beds at last."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e76", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "\"What have we got today?\" Harry asked Ron."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e77", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "note_from_hagrid", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Harry tore it open at once."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e78", "type": "talk", "agent": "severus_snape", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "dungeons", "source_text": "\"Potter!\" said Snape suddenly."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e79", "type": "help", "agent": "professor_quirrell", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hogwarts", "source_text": "rescued by Professor Quirrell, who was passing."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e80", "type": "attack", "agent": "peeves", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hogwarts", "source_text": "pelt you with bits of chalk"}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e81", "type": "injure", "agent": "neville_longbottom", "patient": null, "location": "dungeons", "source_text": "moaned in pain as angry red boils sprang up all over his arms and legs."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e82", "type": "talk", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hagrid_house", "source_text": "Harry told Hagrid about Snape\u2019s lesson."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e83", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "null", "location": "hagrid_house", "source_text": "It was a cutting from the Daily Prophet: GRINGOTTS BREAKIN LATEST"}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e84", "type": "talk", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "hagrid_house", "source_text": "\u201cHow\u2019s yer brother Charlie?\u201d Hagrid asked Ron."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e85", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "remembrall", "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "Neville was trying to remember what he\u2019d forgotten when Draco Malfoy, who was passing the Gryffindor table, snatched the Remembrall out of his hand."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e86", "type": "take", "agent": "draco_malfoy", "patient": "remembrall", "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "Malfoy quickly dropped the Remembrall back on the table."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e87", "type": "injure", "agent": "null", "patient": "neville_longbottom", "location": "grounds", "source_text": "Neville was rising straight up like a cork shot out of a bottle \u2014 twelve feet \u2014 twenty feet."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e88", "type": "help", "agent": "madam_hooch", "patient": "neville_longbottom", "location": "grounds", "source_text": "Madam Hooch was bending over Neville, her face as white as his."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e89", "type": "talk", "agent": "draco_malfoy", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "grounds", "source_text": "Come and get it, Potter!"}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e90", "type": "take", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "remembrall", "location": "grounds", "source_text": "He caught it, just in time to pull his broom straight."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e91", "type": "talk", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "grounds", "source_text": "Potter, follow me, now."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e92", "type": "meet", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "oliver_wood", "location": "castle", "source_text": "Potter, this is Oliver Wood."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e93", "type": "discover", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "trapdoor", "location": "forbidden_corridor", "source_text": "It was standing on a trapdoor. It\u2019s obviously guarding something."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e94", "type": "escape", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "null", "location": "forbidden_corridor", "source_text": "They fell backward \u2014 Harry slammed the door shut, and they ran."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e95", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "nimbus_two_thousand", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "It contains your new Nimbus Two Thousand."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e96", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Harry had difficulty hiding his glee as he handed the note to Ron to read."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e97", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "oliver_wood", "location": "quidditch_field", "source_text": "Oliver Wood will meet you tonight on the Quidditch field at seven o\u2019clock."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e98", "type": "talk", "agent": "oliver_wood", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "quidditch_field", "source_text": "Very nice, said Wood, his eyes glinting."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e99", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "golden_snitch", "location": "quidditch_field", "source_text": "This, said Wood, is the Golden Snitch."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e100", "type": "talk", "agent": "professor_quirrell", "patient": "null", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Troll \u2014 in the dungeons \u2014 thought you ought to know."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e101", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "hermione_granger", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "Hermione! they said together."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e102", "type": "attack", "agent": "troll", "patient": "hermione_granger", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "The troll was advancing on her, knocking the sinks off the walls as it went."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e103", "type": "help", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "hermione_granger", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "Harry then did something that was both very brave and very stupid."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e104", "type": "help", "agent": "ron_weasley", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "The club flew suddenly out of the troll\u2019s hand."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e105", "type": "arrive", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "null", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "Professor McGonagall had come bursting into the room."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e106", "type": "talk", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "professor_mcgonagall", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "Please, Professor McGonagall \u2014 they were looking for me."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e107", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "severus_snape", "location": "staffroom", "source_text": "Snape was holding his robes above his knees. One of his legs was bloody and mangled."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e108", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "In a low whisper, Harry told them what he\u2019d seen."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e109", "type": "play", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "golden_snitch", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "Harry followed Fred and George out of the locker room and, hoping his knees weren\u2019t going to give way, walked onto the field to loud cheers."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e110", "type": "attack", "agent": "marcus_flint", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "Marcus Flint had blocked Harry on purpose, and Harry\u2019s broom spun off course."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e111", "type": "discover", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "severus_snape", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "I knew it, Hermione gasped, Snape \u2014 look."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e112", "type": "help", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "Bright blue flames shot from her wand onto the hem of Snape\u2019s robes."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e113", "type": "catch", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "golden_snitch", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "I\u2019ve got the Snitch! he shouted, waving it above his head."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e114", "type": "talk", "agent": "ron_weasley", "patient": "hagrid", "location": "hagrids_hut", "source_text": "It was Snape, Ron was explaining, Hermione and I saw him."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e115", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "hagrid", "location": "hagrids_hut", "source_text": "I found out something about him, he told Hagrid."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e116", "type": "talk", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hagrids_hut", "source_text": "How do you know about Fluffy? he said."}
